{
  "id": "pnpm-lock",
  "name": "PNPM Lock Yaml File Disclosure",
  "author": "noraj",
  "severity": "INFO",
  "description": "The pnpm-lock.yaml file is similar to the package-lock.json file used by npm or the yarn.lock file used by Yarn. It serves as a lock file that ensures consistent and reproducible installations of dependencies across different environments.\n",
